---
import { Award, ShieldCheck, Printer, ScanFace } from "lucide-react";
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden z-0">
  {/* Fondo y Glows muy sutiles para no ensuciar el blanco */}
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-accent/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
  
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 lg:mb-20">
      <span class="text-accent font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs mb-4 block">Autoridad Clínica</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-slate-900 mb-6 font-bold">
        Por qué elegirnos: Diferenciales que marcan la diferencia
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
        No todas las clínicas son iguales. Combinamos décadas de experiencia con el más alto estándar tecnológico y avales de nivel mundial.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      
      {/* Tarjeta 1: Experiencia */}
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] rounded-[2rem] p-8 hover:shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 group">
        <div class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-primary to-blue-800 mb-4 tracking-tighter">
          +22<span class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold ml-1 text-accent">Años</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Trayectoria</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">De experiencia continua perfeccionando el arte y la ciencia de la odontología de vanguardia.</p>
      </div>

      {/* Tarjeta 2: Volumen */}
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] rounded-[2rem] p-8 hover:shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500 group">
        <div class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-primary to-blue-800 mb-4 tracking-tighter">
          +11<span class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold ml-1 text-accent">Mil</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Pacientes Anuales</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Un volumen que refleja confianza masiva y respalda nuestros resultados clínicos excepcionales.</p>
      </div>

      {/* Tarjeta 3: Certificaciones (Premium/Gold Light) */}
      <div class="md:col-span-1 md:row-span-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-yellow-50/80 to-white border border-yellow-200/50 rounded-[2rem] p-8 lg:p-10 relative overflow-hidden group shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(234,179,8,0.06)] hover:shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(234,179,8,0.12)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-500">
        {/* Gold Glow */}
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-yellow-400/10 blur-3xl rounded-full transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100 opacity-50"></div>
        
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-10 relative z-10">Aval Internacional</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-12 relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-yellow-200/60 flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-600 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-yellow-50 transition-all duration-500">
                <Award className="w-7 h-7" />
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">ISO 9001</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-1">
              Procesos de calidad estrictamente documentados y auditados a nivel global, garantizando excelencia en cada paso.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-100 via-yellow-200/60 to-slate-100"></div>
          
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-yellow-200/60 flex items-center justify-center text-yellow-600 shadow-sm group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-yellow-50 transition-all duration-500">
                <ShieldCheck className="w-7 h-7" />
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Straumann Group</h4>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-1">
              Socios oficiales. Utilizamos implantes Straumann® y Neodent®, líderes mundiales absolutos en implantología.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Tarjeta 4: Tecnología In-House */}
      <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-white border border-slate-100 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] rounded-[2rem] p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center group overflow-hidden relative transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/5 blur-3xl rounded-full opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"></div>
        
        <div class="md:w-1/2 relative z-10">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Laboratorio Digital Propio</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Nuestra infraestructura "In-House" elimina intermediarios, garantizando la máxima celeridad y precisión biométrica en cada etapa de tu tratamiento.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="md:w-1/2 flex flex-row gap-4 relative z-10 w-full">
          <div class="bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-100 p-6 rounded-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500">
            <ScanFace className="w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3" />
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 block mb-1">3</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Escáneres<br/>3D</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2 block border-t border-slate-200 pt-2 w-full">(2 Intra, 1 Extra)</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-slate-50/80 border border-slate-100 p-6 rounded-2xl flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group-hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500 delay-75">
            <Printer className="w-8 h-8 text-primary mb-3" />
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 block mb-1">4</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">Impresoras<br/>Resina</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2 block border-t border-slate-200 pt-2 w-full">Alta Precisión</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
